      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-307903",
      ":question/problem": "A table shows the average annual rainfall in a region for six different years.\n\n| Year | Average rainfall (cm) |\n| --- | ---: |\n| $1985$ | $100$ |\n| $1995$ | $120$ |\n| $2005$ | $150$ |\n| $2010$ | $180$ |\n| $2015$ | $200$ |\n| $2025$ | $220$ |\n\nWhat was the percentage increase in rainfall from $1995$ to $2010$?\n\n> A calculator is required to answer this question."
