      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-307905",
      ":question/problem": "A table shows the total electricity generated by a power plant for six different years.\n\n| Year | Electricity generated (GWh) |\n| --- | ---: |\n| $1980$ | $1000$ |\n| $1990$ | $1500$ |\n| $2000$ | $2000$ |\n| $2010$ | $2600$ |\n| $2020$ | $3000$ |\n| $2025$ | $3600$ |\n\nWhat was the percentage increase in electricity generated from $1980$ to $1990$?\n\n> A calculator is required to answer this question."
